# No end-of-line conversion, anywhere.
#
# launcher.bat must be CRLF or cmd.exe mis-parses it, and README.txt is
# validated as CRLF. Letting git normalise line endings would mean the file in
# the repository differs from the file that ships, and a fresh clone on another
# machine could hand the user a .bat that does not run. Treat everything as
# opaque bytes so what is committed is what ships.
* -text
